{
  "title": { "zh": "硬切频率为何有波纹", "en": "Why hard cutoffs ripple" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "频率处理器已经能改变尺度，现在把它用于突变信号。硬截止与渐变处理都可能让图像变平滑，却产生不同的空间响应；用自己的比较器观察差别。 <wiki-ref to=\"frequency-ringing\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "Apply the filter to abrupt signals. Hard and tapered gains can both smooth an image yet produce different spatial responses. Inspect them with your comparator. <wiki-ref to=\"frequency-ringing\"></wiki-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "<code>y = F⁻¹(g · F(x))</code>\n\nF 表示本游戏的前向变换，F⁻¹ 表示逆向重建。硬截止让 g 在频率边界突然跳变，对应的空间响应会向两侧延伸并交替正负，突变附近就可能出现波纹。渐变减轻这种效应，也会改变细节；必须看原值才能发现过冲。 <wiki-ref to=\"frequency-ringing\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "<code>y = F⁻¹(g · F(x))</code>\n\nF is this game’s forward transform and F⁻¹ its inverse. A hard jump in g corresponds to a spatial response with extended, alternating lobes, which can produce ripples near discontinuities. Tapering reduces this effect but alters detail; raw values are needed to detect overshoot. <wiki-ref to=\"frequency-ringing\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v2_ringing",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "比较滤波形状",
        "en": "Compare filter shapes"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "把同一信号分别送入硬截止与渐变增益，输出两种重建及它们的差异大小。保留小于 0 或大于 1 的原始计算值。",
        "en": "Process one signal with hard and tapered gains; output both reconstructions and their difference magnitude. Preserve values below 0 or above 1."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "突变信号", "en": "Abrupt signal" } },
        { "name": "hard", "label": { "zh": "硬截止增益", "en": "Hard-cutoff gain" } },
        { "name": "taper", "label": { "zh": "渐变增益", "en": "Tapered gain" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "hardResult", "label": { "zh": "硬截止重建", "en": "Hard-cutoff reconstruction" } },
        { "name": "taperResult", "label": { "zh": "渐变重建", "en": "Tapered reconstruction" } },
        { "name": "changed", "label": { "zh": "两种响应差异", "en": "Response difference" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1]],
            "hard": [[1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1]],
            "taper": [[1, 0.7, 0.25, 0, 0, 0, 0.25, 0.7]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "hardResult": [
              [
                0.25,
                -0.10355339059327343,
                -0.1035533905932732,
                0.24999999999999972,
                0.7499999999999994,
                1.1035533905932735,
                1.1035533905932742,
                0.7499999999999991
              ]
            ],
            "taperResult": [
              [
                0.3250000000000002,
                0.07751262658470863,
                0.07751262658470857,
                0.3249999999999998,
                0.6749999999999997,
                0.9224873734152915,
                0.9224873734152917,
                0.6749999999999994
              ]
            ],
            "changed": [
              [
                0.07500000000000018,
                0.18106601717798204,
                0.18106601717798176,
                0.07500000000000007,
                0.07499999999999973,
                0.18106601717798199,
                0.18106601717798243,
                0.07499999999999973
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]],
            "hard": [[1, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1]],
            "taper": [[1, 0.7, 0.25, 0, 0, 0, 0.25, 0.7]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "hardResult": [
              [
                0.625,
                0.30177669529663687,
                -0.12500000000000006,
                -0.0517766952966368,
                0.125,
                -0.051776695296637025,
                -0.12500000000000008,
                0.3017766952966371
              ]
            ],
            "taperResult": [
              [
                0.3625,
                0.2487436867076458,
                0.062499999999999965,
                0.0012563132923542237,
                0.012500000000000011,
                0.0012563132923542279,
                0.06249999999999994,
                0.24874368670764602
              ]
            ],
            "changed": [
              [
                0.2625,
                0.05303300858899107,
                0.18750000000000003,
                0.05303300858899103,
                0.11249999999999999,
                0.05303300858899125,
                0.18750000000000003,
                0.05303300858899107
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [],
      "solution": [
        "h = frequencyFilter(image,hard)",
        "s = frequencyFilter(image,taper)",
        "d = difference(h,s)",
        "hardResult <- h",
        "taperResult <- s",
        "changed <- d"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "h = frequencyFilter(image,hard)",
        "s = frequencyFilter(image,hard)",
        "d = difference(h,s)",
        "hardResult <- h",
        "taperResult <- s",
        "changed <- d"
      ],
      "views": { "grid": ["plot", "numbers", "pixels"] },
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "平滑形状取决于增益形状，重复硬截止不会得到渐变处理。检查突变附近的振荡与细节损失。",
        "en": "Filter shape follows gain shape; repeating a hard cutoff does not produce tapered filtering. Inspect oscillation and detail loss near discontinuities."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "点开突变附近的格子查看原值。显示截断可能隐藏过冲，不能据此宣称没有振铃。",
          "en": "Inspect raw cells near the discontinuity; display clipping can hide overshoot, not eliminate ringing."
        }
      ],
      "adds": []
    }
  ]
}
